# The wide frame's sidebar folded to the rail's bar and opened again, shown a while as the pointer comes on the bar
# and folded again as it leaves (brand.tsx moveSidebar, Rail.tsx peekSidebar): MBUI_FIXTURE=webdemo MBUI_WIN=1280x800,
# beside the web's own (the same steps, its stories' demo): 对话 pressed again (folded, shown a while: the pointer is on
# the rail), the pointer away (folded again), on 文件 in the bar (shown a while), away, 对话 pressed in the bar (open).
timeout 20000
until 新建对话
wait 600
tap 把那个弄一下
wait 900
move 1000 700
wait 300
hover icon:chats
wait 200
tap icon:chats
wait 900
move 1000 400
wait 1600
hover icon:folder
wait 900
move 1000 400
wait 1600
hover icon:chats
wait 200
tap icon:chats
wait 900
exit
